                                                "sense_id": "27c3ef1e-b332-3922-9df3-9bf9fae3d622",
                                                "text": "His reference to waves of lorries on the A55 that match ferry schedules may become dated. Until very recently, the A55 formed part of a land bridge between Ireland and continental Europe. However, when Britain left the European Union, ferries started to ply a direct sea link from Ireland, [...]."
